      A* ============================================================
      A* TDSTPRTR - Printer File for TDSTRPGLE Audit Report
      A* Library : GURILIB  Source : QDDSSRC  Member : TDSTPRTR
      A* Reproduces DFU audit report format (132 cols, spacing 1)
      A* ============================================================
      A                                      PAGESIZE(66 132)
      A* ============================================================
      A* HDR - Page header line (skips to top of page)
      A*   Col  3 : OS version string (fixed literal)
      A*   Col 40 : 'Audit Log'
      A*   Col 50 : Date yy/mm/dd (6A, RPG-formatted)
      A*   Col 59 : Time hh:mm:ss (8A, RPG-formatted)
      A*   Col 68 : 'Page'
      A*   Col 75 : page number right-justified (4Y0, EDTCDE 4)
      A* ============================================================
      A          R HDR
      A                                      SKIPA(1)
      A                                  1  3'5770SS1  V7R5M0  220415'
      A                                  1 40'Audit Log'
      A            HDRDAT         6A  O  1 50
      A            HDRTIM         8A  O  1 59
      A                                  1 68'Page'
      A            HDRPAG         4Y 0O  1 75EDTCDE(4)
      A* ============================================================
      A* PGM - Program/Library line
      A* ============================================================
      A          R PGM
      A                                      SPACEB(1)
      A                                  1  4'Program/Library . . . .   GURILIB/TDSTRPGLE'
      A* ============================================================
      A* MBR - Member line
      A* ============================================================
      A          R MBR
      A                                      SPACEB(1)
      A                                  1  4'Member  . . . . . .   QCUSTCDT'
      A* ============================================================
      A* JOB - Job title line
      A* ============================================================
      A          R JOB
      A                                      SPACEB(1)
      A                                  1  4'Job Title . . . .   TESTDFU'
      A* ============================================================
      A* CNTLIN - Count line (reused for add / change / delete)
      A*   Col 16 : right-justified count (5P0, EDTCDE 1)
      A*   Col 23 : label text (30A, set by RPG before each WRITE)
      A* ============================================================
      A          R CNTLIN
      A                                      SPACEB(1)
      A            CNTVAL         5P 0O  1 16EDTCDE(1)
      A            CNTTXT        30A  O  1 23
      A* ============================================================
      A* FOOTER - End-of-report trailer (2 blank lines before)
      A* ============================================================
      A          R FOOTER
      A                                      SPACEB(2)
      A                                  1 20'* * * * * D F U  A U D I T  R E P O R T  E N D * * * * *'
